{"id":"wb-5-451","name":"梵天寺经幢","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"梵天寺经幢","text":"梵天寺经幢位于中国浙江省杭州市上城区凤凰山东麓梵天寺路，为原梵天讲寺遗物，北宋乾德三年（965年）吴越国王钱俶重建南塔寺时所建。2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n梵天寺经幢共有一对，相距十余米，两者形制相同，高15.76米，幢身八面，雕刻精美。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A2%B5%E5%A4%A9%E5%AF%BA%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2","revisionId":86591651,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86591651","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b4d44a5095e734a94b2e98b1.jpg","title":"Stone_Pillars_of_Brahma_Temple,_2018-10-28_12.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stone_Pillars_of_Brahma_Temple,_2018-10-28_12.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/Stone_Pillars_of_Brahma_Temple%2C_2018-10-28_12.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​梵天寺经幢","width":320,"height":214}}